INTERFACE zif_osd_rap_registry PUBLIC.
* The behavior definitions of the tree, generated by tools/rap/bdef-gen.mjs
* as ZCL_OSD_RAP_REGISTRY in gen/rap/ (docs/rap-runtime.md). The runtime
* creates that class by name, so a tree without any behavior definition
* still compiles: there is simply no registry to find.

  TYPES tt_name TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF string WITH DEFAULT KEY.

* the adapter of one behavior definition, or an initial reference
  METHODS get
    IMPORTING
      iv_bdef      TYPE csequence
    RETURNING
      VALUE(ro_bo) TYPE REF TO zif_osd_rap_bo.

* every behavior definition with an adapter, sorted
  METHODS list
    RETURNING
      VALUE(rt_bdef) TYPE tt_name.

* R5: a projection entity (docs/rap-runtime.md, "Projections"): the base
* entity it runs on, the field map (projection element NAME = base element
* BASE), what it uses (CREATE, UPDATE, DELETE, ACTIONS, ASSOCS, and CREATES
* for use association _x { create; }) and its own READONLY fields. Initial
* when IV_ENTITY is no projection entity. R10: MODIFY the calculated
* elements field ( modify ) lets the augment write, UNION the generated class
* serving its active and draft rows (use draft), AUGMENT the generated class
* (ZIF_OSD_RAP_AUGMENT) of use create / update ( augment )
  TYPES:
    BEGIN OF ty_map,
      name TYPE string,
      base TYPE string,
    END OF ty_map,
    tt_map TYPE STANDARD TABLE OF ty_map WITH DEFAULT KEY,
    BEGIN OF ty_projection,
      entity      TYPE string,
      alias       TYPE string,
      bdef        TYPE string,
      base_bdef   TYPE string,
      base_entity TYPE string,
      create      TYPE abap_bool,
      update      TYPE abap_bool,
      delete      TYPE abap_bool,
      actions     TYPE tt_name,
      assocs      TYPE tt_name,
      creates     TYPE tt_name,
      fields      TYPE tt_map,
      readonly    TYPE tt_name,
      modify      TYPE tt_name,
      union       TYPE string,
      augment     TYPE string,
    END OF ty_projection.
  METHODS projection
    IMPORTING
      iv_entity            TYPE csequence
    RETURNING
      VALUE(rs_projection) TYPE ty_projection.

ENDINTERFACE.
